#. module: sign_emsigner
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sign_emsigner/controllers/main.py:0
msgid "Emsigner only supports signing a single document at a time."
msgstr "Emsigner ຮອງຮັບການລົງລາຍເຊັນພຽງແຕ່ເອກະສານດຽວຕໍ່ຄັ້ງ."

#. module: sign_emsigner
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sign_emsigner/wizard/sign_send_request.py:0
msgid ""
"Emsigner role cannot be signed first. Please keep emsigner as last signer."
msgstr ""
"ບົດບາດ Emsigner ບໍ່ສາມາດລົງລາຍເຊັນເປັນຄົນທຳອິດໄດ້. ກະລຸນາໃຫ້ emsigner ເປັນຜູ້ລົງລາຍເຊັນຄົນສຸດທ້າ"
"ຍ."

#. module: sign_emsigner
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sign_emsigner/models/sign_request.py:0
msgid ""
"Emsigner role cannot be used for signing directly. Please send the request "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"ບົດບາດ Emsigner ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອລົງລາຍເຊັນໂດຍກົງໄດ້. ກະລຸນາສົ່ງຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍແທນ."

